WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:35.466
[...]

00:00:35.466 --> 00:01:05.832
[Patient is draped and prepped for surgery.]

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:19.433
[...]

00:01:19.433 --> 00:02:21.999
[Local anesthesia is administered.]

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:29.266
[...]

00:02:29.266 --> 00:03:26.732
[Scalpels and other instruments are shown.]

00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:34.399
[...]

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:53.433
[A machine for nitrous oxide and ether is brought over to the hospital bed and a mask placed over the patient's face.]

00:03:53.433 --> 00:04:39.599
[Components are adjusted.]

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:53.266
[...]

00:04:53.266 --> 00:05:19.066
[The patient's chest is opened up and surgery commences.]

00:05:19.066 --> 00:05:29.032
[...]

00:05:29.033 --> 00:06:46.299
[Blood vessels are clamped and additional incisions made as surgery continues.]

00:06:46.300 --> 00:07:07.633
[...]

00:07:07.633 --> 00:07:45.566
[Portions of the ribs are removed.]

00:07:45.566 --> 00:07:56.766
[...]

00:07:56.766 --> 00:08:48.099
[Surgeons begin to sew up the patient and close the incision.]

00:08:48.100 --> 00:09:06.966
[...]

00:09:06.966 --> 00:09:18.432
[The sewn-up incision is shown and gauze is applied.]

00:09:18.433 --> 00:09:41.133
[...]

00:09:41.133 --> 00:11:32.433
[Another chest surgery is shown.]

00:11:32.433 --> 00:11:37.333
[...]

00:11:37.333 --> 00:11:43.099
[The exposed lung inflates and deflates.]

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:55.066
[...]

00:11:55.066 --> 00:12:27.266
[Rib resection is shown.]

00:12:27.266 --> 00:12:35.666
[...]

00:12:35.666 --> 00:12:45.166
[The surgeon points to the subclavian artery.]

00:12:45.166 --> 00:12:55.899
[...]

00:12:55.900 --> 00:13:59.766
[The incision is closed.]

